    "detailed_description": "Emo, a lonely teenager, has decided to run away from home and walk Misery Street in pursuit of meaning. But the street brings out the worst within ones-self. Emo will have to overcome a world of delusional foes as well as the demons from his past. No one has yet to reach the end of Misery Street... Will Emo be the first?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20+ hours of playtime with a special New Game+ mode.<br></li><li>A non-linear story with plenty of optional paths that will give you powerful items.<br></li><li>Freaky characters that feel alive, even though everyone is dead inside.<br></li><li>A shy companion to talk to and bond with. Your relationship may affect the events to come.<br></li><li>Secrets. Lots of secrets.</li></ul><br><i>If you experience a lot of lag, please try the Lag Free Beta branch.</i>",
